# ---- Trained artifacts ----
# models/*.joblib and reports/metrics.json ARE committed, deliberately: they
# total ~7 MB and Streamlit Community Cloud serves the app straight from the
# repo, with no build step available to train on deploy. Regenerate anytime
# with `PYTHONPATH=src python -m fakereview.train`.
models/*.pkl
reports/*.png

